    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. Use it as your opponent's Shooting phase begins, on one friendly SMOKE unit. Until that phase is over, any attack aimed at that unit, or at a unit the attacker cannot fully see because models in your chosen SMOKE unit block the view, gives its target the Benefit of Cover. Like any Stratagem, it can be used only once in a phase.",
